      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/RepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a> that sets up interceptors to read metadata information from the invoked method.\nThis is necessary to allow redeclaration of CRUD methods in repository interfaces and configure locking information\nor query hints on them.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/RepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a> 用于设置拦截器，以从被调用的方法中读取元数据信息。这是必要的，因为它允许在仓库接口中重新声明 CRUD 方法，并配置这些方法上的锁信息或查询提示。",
      "count": 1
